      "number_raw": "100",
      "source_number": "100",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你看见安柏尔，末世论者的一个教师。",
      "source_text": "你看见安柏尔，末世论者的一个教师。",
      "source_line_start": 1,
      "source_line_end": 1,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 2,
      "number": 101,
      "number_raw": "101",
      "source_number": "101",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "现在是我休息的时候。请在晚上再来。",
      "source_text": "现在是我休息的时候。请在晚上再来。",
      "source_line_start": 2,
      "source_line_end": 2,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 3,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "欢迎，高贵的旅行者。你是来这里钻研的吗？",
      "source_text": "欢迎，高贵的旅行者。你是来这里钻研的吗？",
      "source_line_start": 3,
      "source_line_end": 3,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 4,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "不。我实际上只是来这里杀人。",
      "source_text": "不。我实际上只是来这里杀人。",
      "source_line_start": 4,
      "source_line_end": 4,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 5,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "这要看你想教我什么。",
      "source_text": "这要看你想教我什么。",
      "source_line_start": 5,
      "source_line_end": 5,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 6,
      "number": 105,
      "number_raw": "105",
      "source_number": "105",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "是的，我愿意学。",
      "source_text": "是的，我愿意学。",
      "source_line_start": 6,
      "source_line_end": 6,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 7,
      "number": 106,
      "number_raw": "106",
      "source_number": "106",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我很遗憾听你这么说。末世论相信和平是无价的。因为这点，我已经自愿放弃使用暴力。晚安。",
      "source_text": "我很遗憾听你这么说。末世论相信和平是无价的。因为这点，我已经自愿放弃使用暴力。晚安。",
      "source_line_start": 7,
      "source_line_end": 7,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 8,
      "number": 107,
      "number_raw": "107",
      "source_number": "107",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我精通多种语言和艺术。或许你想学其中的一项？",
      "source_text": "我精通多种语言和艺术。或许你想学其中的一项？",
      "source_line_start": 8,
      "source_line_end": 8,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 9,
      "number": 108,
      "number_raw": "108",
      "source_number": "108",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "抱歉，不过我需要知道能帮助我生存的事情。",
      "source_text": "抱歉，不过我需要知道能帮助我生存的事情。",
      "source_line_start": 9,
      "source_line_end": 9,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 10,
      "number": 109,
      "number_raw": "109",
      "source_number": "109",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "我没有时间花在这种东西上。走了。",
      "source_text": "我没有时间花在这种东西上。走了。",
      "source_line_start": 10,
      "source_line_end": 10,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 11,
      "number": 110,
      "number_raw": "110",
      "source_number": "110",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "或许我能听一两首歌。",
      "source_text": "或许我能听一两首歌。",
      "source_line_start": 11,
      "source_line_end": 11,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 12,
      "number": 111,
      "number_raw": "111",
      "source_number": "111",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你能教我点别的么？",
      "source_text": "你能教我点别的么？",
      "source_line_start": 12,
      "source_line_end": 12,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 13,
      "number": 112,
      "number_raw": "112",
      "source_number": "112",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "啊, 我们这里有个生命的研习者。如此，我能教你些草药知识，只不过势必需时多而所获少。",
      "source_text": "啊, 我们这里有个生命的研习者。如此，我能教你些草药知识，只不过势必需时多而所获少。",
      "source_line_start": 13,
      "source_line_end": 13,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 14,
      "number": 113,
      "number_raw": "113",
      "source_number": "113",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "可以啊，教我吧。",
      "source_text": "可以啊，教我吧。",
      "source_line_start": 14,
      "source_line_end": 14,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 15,
      "number": 114,
      "number_raw": "114",
      "source_number": "114",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "拜托，教我你所会的。",
      "source_text": "拜托，教我你所会的。",
      "source_line_start": 15,
      "source_line_end": 15,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
